    <briefdescription>
<para>Generic Qt Class for displaying Property-Value pairs. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><image type="html" name="PropertyTreeWidget.jpg"></image>
</para><para>The properties can be grouped, each group is displayed in a different color. The view was inspired by the property-editor of Qt-Designer (and uses the same colors)</para><para>This class doesn&apos;t depend on rose, the rose specific version for displaying info&apos;s about SgNode is <ref refid="classNodeInfoWidget" kindref="compound">NodeInfoWidget</ref>. </para>    </detaileddescription>
